<title>JAPAN: M'bishi Motors June exports up 25.8 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>M'bishi Motors June exports up 25.8 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Motors Corp said on Friday that its exports, domestic vehicle production and overseas production in June all rose from the same month a year ago, while domestic sales declined.</p>
<p>The June data, with percentage changes from a year earlier, is as follows:</p>
<p> Production	  111,999   up   19.8 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars		75,334   up   22.7 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus     36,665   up   14.2 percent</p>
<p> Domestic sales     53,488   down  7.7 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars		25,593   down  6.2 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus     27,895   down  9.0 percent</p>
<p> Exports		48,773   up   25.8 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars		36,201   up   35.7 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus     12,572   up    3.9 percent</p>
<p> Overseas output    62,996   up   16.5 percent</p>
<p>The breakdown of data for the January-June period was as follows:</p>
<p> Production	  656,349   up   10.5 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars	     444,963   up   12.1 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus    211,386   up    7.3 percent</p>
<p> Domestic sales    380,411   down  2.2 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars	     198,072   up    7.7 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus    182,339   down 11.1 percent</p>
<p> Exports	     262,540   up   21.4 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars	     185,389   up   33.3 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus     77,151   down  0.1 percent</p>
<p> Overseas output   391,950   up   20.9 percent</p>
</text>
